Foresight v0.4 on the test year: reported once

Split      test: contracts ending 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31
           12 monthly cohorts, 4,076 contracts, 364 leavers
Method     rolling-origin backtest: each cohort scored by a
           model fitted on the 6,414 to 10,051 outcomes
           known at its mark; rule and random on the same rows
Intervals  95%, 2,000 bootstrap resamples of contracts
           within each cohort

Verdict    The model's list beats the rule's at capacity.

                model                rule                   baseline
precision at 40 30.0 (25.8-34.2)     25.6 (22.1-30.0)            8.9
recall at 40    39.6 (34.8-44.2)     33.8 (30.1-38.9)           11.7
AUC             0.769 (0.743-0.794)  0.708 (0.679-0.738)       0.500
log loss        0.272 (0.251-0.295)  -                         0.305
Brier score     0.076 (0.070-0.084)  -                         0.082

Precision and recall in per cent. Baseline: a random
list; for log loss and Brier, the training base rate for
every contract (the rule gives no probability to score).

Model minus rule, paired
  precision at 40   +4.4 points (+0.8 to +6.9)
  recall at 40      +5.8 points (+1.1 to +9.1)
  AUC               +0.061 (+0.036 to +0.085)

cohort mark    contracts  leavers  model hits  rule hits
