A perfect list would reach 75.4% precision.
Not measured here: calibration and value in dollars
(Chapter 14), performance by segment (Chapter 16).

v0.4 (the lasso) minus v0.3 (logistic), paired
  precision at 40   -0.6 points (-2.7 to +1.7)
  AUC               -0.008 (-0.014 to -0.001)

Ceiling: 173 leavers in the top 40s, from the generator's
true probabilities. v0.4 reached 144, v0.3 147.

The test year is now spent for v0.4.
